        "title": "[2607.22988] An Explicit Counterexample to Stanley's Rankwise Lower-Bound Conjecture for Differential Posets",
        "description": "Abstract page for arXiv paper 2607.22988: An Explicit Counterexample to Stanley's Rankwise Lower-Bound Conjecture for Differential Posets",
